# Any hand-made copy of it too. A `.env.bak-<date>` sat untracked in the
# production checkout for thirteen days holding twelve live credentials,
# including broker keys — one careless `git add .` from being published.
# The blanket-stage rule that would have prevented that is a habit; this is
# the mechanical version.
